														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1902727">
									

<p>I dig this. I thought it was going to be a 2001 star child and I don't think it is. It seems like the kid is very downplayed and not actually that important, like hes maybe just a mouthpiece? I did, however, notice this line, &quot;Reality warping events are typically restructuring, and replace the inside of a chamber with a newly fabricated setting.&quot; This seemed a little clumsy to me, it might be better with no comma after &quot;restructuring&quot; and replacement of &quot;replace&quot; with &quot;replacement of&quot;, no syntax pun intended. Also, ultrasonography wouldn't work in a vacuum, no air, no medium, no sound. Maybe a PET scan? Finally, its &quot;metabolic rate&quot; not &quot;metabolism rate&quot;, and saying that it, and breathing and hearth rate, were &quot;retarded&quot; implies that they slowed from a higher point, not that it is slow compared to a regular humans. Those would be my suggestions, but this totally tastes like Vonnegut, which I like. Also makes me thing of a relation to Clefs 001 proposal.<br />
+1</p>

